            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Red-emissive fluorescent probes have been developed by integration of quinoline blue or thiazole red as the base surrogate into triplex-forming PNAs, allowing selective sensing of a sequence of double-stranded RNA.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
